      "updated_at": "2018-04-19T11:44:24Z",
      "body": "We need some dev to take tech lead on that project. I think it can be done in parallel as Spree upgrade as I don't think there is really implications. We have decided to prioritized for Q2. @daniellemoorhead might be good to discuss at next pipeline touchpoint.\r\nI only put one story so far as I would like to organize a quick inception session with the tech lead on it to agree on the path we want to take and split that into stories. I have already shared some ideas in the slides document I put in the inception section in this epic.",
